{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["審判之日將臨"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["這是主耶和華讓我看見的異象：看啊，一籃夏天的果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華問我：「阿摩司，你看見什麼？」我說：「我看見一籃夏天的果子。」祂說：「我以色列子民的結局",{"noteId":5},"到了，我不會再饒恕他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["到那日，宮殿裡的歌聲要變成哀號；屍橫遍地，一片死寂。這是主耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"踐踏貧民、滅絕窮人的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聽！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們盼望朔日","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"和安息日快點過去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們好售賣穀物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們用小升斗賣糧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用加重的砝碼收銀子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用詭詐的秤欺騙人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們用銀子買貧民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以一雙鞋買窮人為奴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"售賣摻了糠秕的麥子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華憑雅各的驕傲起誓：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我決不會忘記你們的所作所為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這片土地要因此而震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的居民都要悲哀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要像尼羅河一樣漲起，如埃及的河流翻騰退落。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「到那日，我要使太陽中午落下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使大地在白天一片黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你們的節期變為喪禮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫你們的歡歌變為哀歌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你們都腰束麻布，剃光頭髮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你們傷心欲絕，如喪獨生子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使那日成為痛苦的日子。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「日子將到，我要使饑荒降在地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人饑餓非因無餅，乾渴非因無水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是因為聽不到耶和華的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們從南到北，從東到西","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在境內四處奔走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要尋找耶和華的話卻找不到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「到那日，",{"text":"「美麗少女和青春少男都要因乾渴而昏倒；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些憑撒瑪利亞、但和別示巴的神明起誓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要跌倒，永不再起來。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"「結局」希伯來文中與「夏天的果子」發音相近。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":2}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"「朔日」即每月初一。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":5}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"「從南到北，從東到西」希伯來文是「從這海到那海，從北到東」。海指西面的地中海和南面的死海。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}